  "question": "Suppose $f(x)$ is a twice differentiable function on $[a,b]$ such that $f(a)=0=f(b)$ and $x^2f^{\\prime\\prime}(x)+4xf^\\prime(x)+2f(x)>0$ for all $x\\in(a,b)$. Then",
